to be honest, if I look at my crystal ball,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.960
I expect that even if there is such an&nbsp;
investigation, at some point we will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:51.840
hear there is really no precedent for charging a&nbsp;
former president of the United States. I know I'm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:58.400
being pessimistic, but that's my crystal ball.&nbsp;
But the next question becomes, would it Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:03.600
announcing his candidacy do anything to shield him&nbsp;
here? And Merrick Garland says the answer is no

